    "explanation": "Rider, the SGD 4.50 no-show cancellation fee charged on TRP-02736 stands; Driver, you are paid SGD 3.60 of it.\n\nThe charge is tested by POL-NS-01, and all four limbs hold. (a) The trip record carries a driver 'arrived' event at 13:24:34. (b) The GPS trace places the driver inside the 50 m STANDARD arrival radius at that same moment — the first qualifying in-geofence fix is at 13:24:34 with a dwell start offset of 0.0 s. (c) The driver then held position inside the geofence for a continuous 428 s (13:24:34 to 13:31:42, 44 qualifying fixes) against the free waiting period of 180 s in force for this trip (trip_record.platform_policy.free_wait_sec = 180; no_show_threshold_sec is null). (d) There is no boarding event, and the driver terminated the trip at 13:31:43 under cancellation_reason_code RIDER_NO_SHOW, 429 s after arrival and so after the required dwell had elapsed.\n\nThe clauses that could displace the fee do not. POL-NS-02: qualifying in-radius fixes exist (44 of them), so arrival is established. POL-NS-03: the fixes lie inside the 50 m radius, not at the wrong face of the venue, and registered_pickup_points is 1, so the clause does not apply. POL-NS-04: Rider, you sent no message during the waiting window, so limb (a) cannot be met and the clause does not exonerate you; the question of your device's position does not have to be reached. POL-NS-05: at the arrival timestamp the trace puts the driver at the pin (min_distance_m 0.0 m) and stationary (0.0 kph), so the marker is not false and no the waiting clock is not recomputed. POL-NS-06: there is no shortfall (428 s against 180 s), and limb (i) is unavailable in any event because EV-ADVIS-02736-01 is MISSING. POL-NS-10: you did not cancel — the driver did.\n\nBecause the fee stands, POL-NS-07 fixes the driver's payout at 80 percent of SGD 4.50 = SGD 3.60, the residual SGD 0.90 being the platform service fee. The anti-farming check does not trip: driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 2 (below 4) and 2/64 = 0.031 (below 0.08); both limbs must hold and neither does. The driver's counterparty statement that he waited past the free period at the pin is consistent with this, but it carries no weight multiplier and does not enter the confidence cap.\n\nWeight and confidence: the arrival and dwell findings rest on EV-GPS-02736, which the pre-pass tagged IMPAIRED at weight 0.85 for issue code GPS_GAP_SHORT_OR_OUTSIDE_WINDOW — a 60.0 s sampling gap from 13:21:14 to 13:22:14. That gap falls before the arrival marker and outside the waiting window, so the 44-fix in-geofence run carrying the dwell is uninterrupted; the finding survives the discount. Confidence is capped at 0.85 by that artifact under POL-GEN-02(2) and so sits above the 0.70 floor. The fare ledger reconciles (SGD 4.50 equals platform_policy.cancellation_fee_sgd), so there is no POL-NS-08(d) defect, and no artifact is impaired under POL-NS-08(a) to (d): POL-NS-09 therefore does not escalate — no contradicting artifacts, no cross-party disputes (both trailing-90-day figures are 0), no abuse pattern, and confidence above the floor.\n\nThe disposition of the fee is NO_ACTION — Rider, your claim is not supported and the charge stands as it is — and because the driver is paid, the emitted ruling value is DRIVER_COMPENSATION, with amount_sgd mirroring the SGD 3.60 payment under POL-GEN-03. The monetary effect, SGD 3.60, is below the SGD 8.00 automatic-execution threshold."
